CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION as_getserviceplandetails(intakeserviceid uuid, _page integer, _limit integer)
 RETURNS TABLE(totalcount bigint, servicerequestnumber character varying, intaserviceid uuid, services json)
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$

DECLARE          
_offset  integer;
v_intakeserviceid uuid;
v_personid uuid;
l_intakeserviceid uuid;

BEGIN
_offset := (_page - 1) * _limit; 

l_intakeserviceid:=intakeserviceid;

select ir.intakeserviceid,ir.personid into v_intakeserviceid,v_personid FROM intakeservicerequestactor ir
join actor a on a.actorid=ir.actorid and a.activeflag=1
join person p1 on p1.personid=a.personid and p1.activeflag=1
     WHERE intakeservicerequestpersontypekey ='RA' 
        AND ir.activeflag =1 and ir.intakeserviceid =l_intakeserviceid;
 
 return Query
select count(1) OVER() as totalcount,
 isr.servicerequestnumber,isr.intakeserviceid,
(SELECT json_agg(item)
FROM (select distinct s.serviceplanlogid, s.objecttypekey, s.objectid, s.serviceplanactivityid,a.activity,a.personinvolved,a.activitysubtypekey,a.completiondate,a.serviceplanactivitystatustypekey,
  s.startdate, s.enddate, s.isrepeats, s.noofoccurence, 
  s.reason, s.serviceplanlogstatustypekey, s.familyworkername,sp.vendorname,stype.servicetypedescription,rv.description,
  (select c.countyname from serviceplanlog spl
    inner join serviceplanvendor sp on sp.serviceplanvendorid=spl.serviceplanvendorid and sp.activeflag=1
    inner join serviceplanactivity sa on sa.serviceplanactivityid=spl.serviceplanactivityid and spl.activeflag=1
    inner join serviceplanvendorsubtypeconfig ssp on ssp.serviceplanvendorid=sp.serviceplanvendorid and ssp.activeflag=1
    inner join county c on c.countyid=ssp.countyid and c.activeflag=1 where spl.objectid::uuid =isr.intakeserviceid limit 1)  countyname
  
  FROM serviceplanlog s
  left join serviceplanactivity a on a.serviceplanactivityid=s.serviceplanactivityid and a.activeflag=1
  left join serviceplanvendor sp on sp.serviceplanvendorid=s.serviceplanvendorid and sp.activeflag=1
  
  left join servicetype stype on stype.servicetypekey = a.servicetypekey and stype.activeflag = 1
  left join referencevalues rv on rv.ref_key=a.activitysubtypekey
  
  where  
  a.objectid::uuid = isr.intakeserviceid) item
) as services
from serviceplanactivity spa
join servicetype ste on ste.servicetypekey=spa.servicetypekey and ste.activeflag=1
join referencevalues rv on rv.ref_key=spa.activitysubtypekey and rv.activeflag=1
join serviceplanlog spl on spl.serviceplanactivityid=spa.serviceplanactivityid and spl.activeflag=1
join serviceplanvendor spv on spv.serviceplanvendorid=spl.serviceplanvendorid and spv.activeflag=1

join intakeservicerequest isr on isr.intakeserviceid=spa.objectid::uuid and isr.activeflag=1
join intakeservicerequestactor isra on isra.intakeserviceid=isr.intakeserviceid

        
join person p on p.personid = isra.personid and p.activeflag =1 
        
   

where  spa.activeflag=1 and spa.objectid::uuid !=l_intakeserviceid and p.personid=v_personid
group by isr.servicerequestnumber,isr.intakeserviceid


LIMIT _limit OFFSET _offset;

END;

$function$

